      "cooked": "<p>Well? Which Personality from the <em><strong>Sentinel Comics Roleplaying Game</strong></em> do you think that you IRL possess?</p>\n<p>You needn’t worry about any of the mechanical implications, just base your decision on theme. In other words, only focus on the name, and don’t care about the rules. (This makes it so that even folks who are not players of the <em><strong>SCRPG</strong></em> can participate!)</p>\n<div class=\"poll\" data-poll-status=\"open\" data-poll-results=\"always\" data-poll-charttype=\"pie\" data-poll-type=\"regular\" data-poll-name=\"poll\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"poll-container\">\n<div class=\"poll-title\">Which Sentinel Comics RPG Personality Are YOU?</div>\n<ul>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"e8b12745f368097219be7c2f9f584540\">Lone Wolf</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"c0b94340b4072dc93f80d512fc9ae4b0\">Natural Leader</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"fa74570f7ac4d3b4f8edc4f7d61850c2\">Impulsive</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"e62d798fd7398c981dbff604d7f2eb3a\">Mischievous</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"d5c9735680e37af6de1e21165a6ba1d1\">Sarcastic</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"db7b99febceec6b3f3db88803a64aa6d\">Distant</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"9ab124c5c68ace7a8f3dc5dd37db4d25\">Stalwart</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"c55f69eb2e90ecb42b0d79756fea98b8\">Fast Talking</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"d22d7e2bab8268fa0571e8ca89bbd802\">Inquisitive</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"108f26f22863fc1d092ed0a47a379d7e\">Alluring</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"cae148736d9ca29a782f7e97b6b8afca\">Stoic</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"55a4560107e4b25d7f13f1a9bdd9549e\">Nurturing</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"8a3a068404ef9a9e72617febbe161adc\">Analytical</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"632faadd44745d8a353a420239048be5\">Decisive</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"06239b3f7651e34c3c5667c13213faa4\">Jovial</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"a4267df5bc1b1f6d36c11500e19bc168\">Cheerful</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"34ad938b91b4b29837e9d42b2631b69f\">Naive</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"d39419ff6b09be03e07dd1d9ffe0a7f0\">Apathetic</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"0bc26692d22ec326a2b211c445245de8\">Jaded</li>\n<li data-poll-option-id=\"8949f9ac8d841940d8b9f501dbf78207\">Arrogant</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"poll-info\">\n<p>\n<span class=\"info-number\">0</span>\n<span class=\"info-label\">voters</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>And, of course, feel free to explain your choice, if you wish!</p>",
