      "raw": "Well? Which Personality from the ***Sentinel Comics Roleplaying Game*** do you think that you IRL possess?\n\nYou needn’t worry about any of the mechanical implications, just base your decision on theme. In other words, only focus on the name, and don’t care about the rules. (This makes it so that even folks who are not players of the ***SCRPG*** can participate!)\n\n[poll type=regular results=always chartType=pie]\n# Which Sentinel Comics RPG Personality Are YOU?\n* Lone Wolf\n* Natural Leader\n* Impulsive\n* Mischievous\n* Sarcastic\n* Distant\n* Stalwart\n* Fast Talking\n* Inquisitive\n* Alluring\n* Stoic\n* Nurturing\n* Analytical\n* Decisive\n* Jovial\n* Cheerful\n* Naive\n* Apathetic\n* Jaded\n* Arrogant\n[/poll]\nAnd, of course, feel free to explain your choice, if you wish!",
