      "raw": "[quote=\"Godai, post:2, topic:29657, full:true\"]\nI am once again asking for the polls on this site to use contrasting colors, not similar colors\n[/quote]\nWell, I’m afraid that I can’t do anything about that, unfortunately.\n\n[quote=\"TakeWalker, post:3, topic:29657\"]\nAnd like, a smaller pie chart. c.c I can’t scroll it right!\n[/quote]\n[quote=\"MindWanderer, post:4, topic:29657, full:true\"]\nYeah, all I can see is a quarter of the graph, and it’s all blue with a sliver of black.\n[/quote]\nThat is *very* unusual. Why would it do that? A bug, perhaps.\n\nI can see the whole graph on my smartphone, but not on a tablet. I haven’t tried to view it on a desktop. Curiouser and curiouser . . .\n\nAnyways, I don’t think that I can fix the chart, but I can post the results thus far for everyone to see:\n**6 votes — Analytical**\n**2 votes each — Inquisitive & Lone Wolf**\n**1 vote each — Arrogant, Mischievous, Stoic, & Nurturing**\n\nI suppose that I shouldn’t be surprised that the three top Personalities are all stereotypically geeky. : )\n\nI will admit that I am one of the six analytics. It was between either that or Inquisitive, but I believe that I also possess shades of several of the other Personalities.",
